<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
at May 31, 2025 the warrants have <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding_iI_do_c20250531_zi4evwDCRZFi" title="Class of warrant or right outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2025-05-31" id="Fact000756" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">no</ix:nonFraction></span> intrinsic value (August 31, 2024 &#8211; <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding_iI_dxL_c20240831_zCGgTaBDHuS8" title="Class of warrant or right outstanding::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl0758">nil</span></span>).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


