</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AF_zbjoWrtNuK4e" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
at May 31, 2025, the options have <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingIntrinsicValue_iI_do_c20250531_znM566Rf73Yi" title="Weighted average intrinsic value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingIntrinsicValue" contextRef="AsOf2025-05-31" id="Fact000806" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">no</ix:nonFraction></span> intrinsic value (August 31, 2024 &#8211; <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingIntrinsicValue_iI_dxL_c20240831_zrl2A7ICnLj4" title="Weighted average intrinsic value of options outstanding::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl0808">nil</span></span>). As at May 31, 2025, all options are exercisable with
a weighted average remaining life of <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm1_dtY_c20240901__20250531_zxDybhutTiK9" title="Weighted average remaining life in years"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-09-01to2025-05-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000810" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm1">1.10</ix:nonNumeric></span>years (August 31, 2024 &#8211; <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm1_dtY_c20230901__20240831_zxKZsiOvrCka" title="Weighted average remaining life in years"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-09-012024-08-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000812" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm1">1.8</ix:nonNumeric></span> years)</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


